## The brief

Acme Co had grown past their original brand. The wordmark looked like 2014, the site took five seconds to load, and the team couldn't edit a single page without a developer.

## What I did

Two weeks of discovery, then a focused brand sprint and a four week site build on this exact stack (Astro plus Keystatic). Handover included a 30 minute video walkthrough and a one page brand guide.

## Outcome

The new site went live in late 2025. Within a quarter, conversion rate on the contact page doubled and the marketing team was publishing weekly without touching code.
